"You cannot talk. You cannot talk! You are a slave, a tool!\nYou are mine! Be quiet!\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*As his mind drifts off you notice part of the summoning circle is fading. You can probably escape!*#WHITE#\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"你不可能说话，你不可能说话的啊！你是一个奴隶，一件工具！\n你是我的，安静点！\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*当他的注意力开始分散时，你注意到召唤法阵的一部分正在消退，你应该可以逃出去！*#WHITE#\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f1b1946ec1479078ead405bf89987c8d60c4b539800318a2a0810b8ef461a279","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c276a7bbce372f06de7527273f15fc61e483970fc489d0844ec9ebde797f7bfd","logical_entry_identity":"e0d703f6866c81d9a24b30f414ca80212c27d27f60a0766af2b9ec86485d996e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"pierced","source_tag":"_t","target":"被刺穿"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2dec1b8fd8169d2650b0193899132d4513cc8172d2b54595c87414f485801394","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c278a36575a41601c0a6ac7eb6c009f87dab176c91ec2c57a206697a754b51af","logical_entry_identity":"e2c2301169bee8998dc19e3f1937ceb89edb3566255c89104b403c5522aa1a03","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Summon the power of the Sun to burn your foes.","source_tag":"_t","target":"召唤太阳之力灼烧敌人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ca4ae5e06b7ac1a2479f553984f8189ccc9772ccce9e3841be4e4957a353294d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c27a7479d2623f2dc86689fa569fa2f0fcac9b00f6fb44ce01e975a1eb655dc1","logical_entry_identity":"bad3d885911760bea63ca7d79b5bc16db71339b60415644a9f35fed4cebfb5e4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"luminosity","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"发光"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bdae552bf6e0894509e0f3f28e916ff81b45851aee12414439393e2a0c55711f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c280e16ce9f05e35368da58845e6c24cb7b1a4dc7f634c228d3be4cd4ef395ee","logical_entry_identity":"b7fc81c13596d566b97d672218d569bcff95c2d3bfe4cde7be516fab45c5ddb5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Interact with the Golem","source_tag":"talent name","target":"检查傀儡"},{"arg