9c589cf7bb8880fd767d3cb587c909d70ccef2f92a94b4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Stealthed","source_tag":"_t","target":"潜行"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5c8a08fea868c199616b351343b027935460dd42488cf00d679cbb00506da2ab","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c29baf081551258b89a696c99623134d6457e634f64b492ed99276f63db70fa8","logical_entry_identity":"eb0181eb9e7a27aa9c05cae41795ed27092da0e1caa2f4d2c72279215bc58b5f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"All talent cooldowns reduced by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"所有技能冷却减少 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f7074be3a57a53aec008a86329674fd6cb5a6b8c142f5cf341b6c4c780be7cc3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2a60325d634a8fbf3bec25156ce09635bb6bc55d86b7822f37e40e81afc8243","logical_entry_identity":"12b7e3944a588e628d8ccb13bab63cd7049ad5ef9bbcbb8bc75926d338736e87","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You demonstrate your dedication to the light with a measured attack striking once with your weapon for %d%% Light damage and once with your shield for %d%% Light damage.\n\t\t\tIf the first strike connects %d random talent cooldowns are reduced by 1.\n\t\t\tIf the second strike connects you are cleansed of %d debuffs.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你以一次沉稳的攻击展现对圣光的奉献：先用武器攻击造成 %d%% 光系伤害，再用盾牌攻击造成 %d%% 光系伤害。\n\t\t\t如果第一次攻击命中，随机 %d 个技能冷却时间减少1回合。\n\t\t\t如果第二次攻击命中，除去你身上至多 %d 个负面状态。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0754ff7939896317017e65ded5d1f92b8c89d15f0933c51bf01f417ff3aa9ff3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2a6e0a621ab5794b4b6950624cf7a0b30517e20cdd67084f07850482e17bd6d","logical_entry_identity":"63411ac7b53fd97cb3792eac30c4b7e8e890d6af72a9bdd1d11817866d93b020","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Well, you see, it's quite simple. I will mentally take control of various wild creatures or slaves while you use the orb of command on the other side of this room to take control of a slave.\nThen we fight using our pawns for 10 rounds. If your slave survives you will win the Bloodcaller.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你看，很简单。我会精神控制各种野生生物或奴隶，你则用房间另一头的指令水晶球控制一个奴隶。\n然后我们操纵各自的棋子对战10轮。如果你的奴隶活了下来，你就会赢得“鲜血呼唤”。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eb4edbc7b3abe1140b5a7b73be5f3ec8cf74296fbfc86cd3f13b5c89e2fe2a36","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2ad71508c8872ff59ea1e8ead1c00d1d443071e8d1d84affa86d653ab7154b7","logical_entry_identity":"a2c7e24964907ad9b3f7b6fa189440ad8d0981b49abefd1f523d3006d1de0e38","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You can't move there.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"你不能移动至那里。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"90f52a488fff6d119c2fc4b683133c99b47c8514c1a6ee2751c42fd894d68971","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2ae280ccadb8b7150dc439a62af08eea907cefdce35d29a9d4e1748a0780e23","logical_entry_identity":"49052a335457fa3b379ef083c51701a71596c72ee5948cd7f623c041358a3f87","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Weapon Warding","source_tag":"_t","target":"武器格挡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"08a7eae217c219317c36ae1e60719c99dd4f9700a2098e407e600597a78cba97","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2b24f9d0cb0cf419501478632bb540e66f22141c540de68e624714988e788f1","logical_entry_identity":"e59e32db0cb903b0166bec7443598e687431f8a6c2480fa9109f316143b8e635","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Draconic Body","source_tag":"talent name","target":"巨龙身躯"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1794964b73fd73baa73359fcc7b915dceeb796820e02a6d33c12c18a0b829efc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2b9f022cbef4934da3b8d617245278281289db0a70f214e1d757d35e7a4ae1c","logical_entry_identity":"4d0f59f712d4b77319ac55695e9d5e314d3b976d92047308b346488962b06da8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Creates a radius 5 gravitic anomaly lasting up to %d turns.  Hostile creatures are dealt %d temporal damgae and pulled in.  Triggers out to range 1.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"制造范围 5 的重力异常，持续 %d 回合。敌对生物受到 %d 时空伤害并被拉过去。触发距离最小为1。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b072261107f15ec56288e93121f2bad114636a3603b4b6e6defc42fa2ad9a978","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2bf249b67f8249a8d774dad74456e366a3adb232b24e11ca0211b7a57703c2a","logical_entry_identity":"8ddfa5942314b5df4f03569a3677a39eeec88148b5654fff014d96293a2fc371","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Corrupted heart of the Sandworm Queen","source_tag":"entity name","target":"腐化沙虫女皇之心"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e3ae2054ef3a9b0fa92482115d4e369167e2f2dc470b3cc27c46d4e0b7f1b991","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2c23b931ee1f3e52dcd660475a03486e3560fafdb79f2771f9337cd872d2167","logical_entry_identity":"16efccb90b9a5895be9019df1b41aa1fba0fceea0fca506b86af8013fc5439fe","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"cleanse your mind of up to %d (based on Magic) detrimental mental effects","source_tag":"tformat","target":"净化你的思想，解除至多%d个（基于魔法）负面精神状态。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e7b2b838e6d88cbca0dbd8135431245fea0a69090ec0aeb49c91b56890826512","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2c2731127dc48314edd24a76e3756e0334c7b10892121ea3cf0c16f2f86e1e1","logical_entry_identity":"4bc68ab77d9081de37fac09982beb1a31213aad2367c7014832db8e427360208","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Some are cursed with mental powers beyond their full control, turning them to a dark life powered by hatred.","source_tag":"init.lua load_tips","target":"某些人被诅咒，获得了超出自身完全掌控的精神力量，从此堕入由仇恨驱动的黑暗生涯。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"84ab0a0785f412928ff2067fa34e9aeb4bdf656244f7849de9e030384c533b8f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2c8fdbbf3dd3a3dfa2a93f2194a50573bb78cb0b504c65e0e3436ab884c25d0","logical_entry_identity":"243210c510a9c1d93a414877dd9c4a8eccaed5efee359281e2743c178f6a30f3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Project a bolt of time distortion, decreasing the target's global speed by %d%% and all projectiles it fires by %d%% for 7 turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"发射一枚时间扭曲弹，减少目标 %d%% 的全局速度，并使目标所释放的抛射物减速 %d%%，持续 7 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1d3ff4f7a89700e40455881967f16a8d5876baee7eca1ead3fb8ebe6bc622681","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2cddc05575f3b924be4a4b5fa519d96fd111686d038f68303f0d617ec6bd5e8","logical_entry_identity":"1446e847211cd93dd859b1f987ccb26d4e102e5091378eb3893580f60d4ca6f2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Mouse Click","source_tag":"_t","target":"鼠标点击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9ea488393c97c74853dfa6a8ae0ca235510a90c27621dc7a2054ed1e6c50d188","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2cec3cb9bfe28580959aefbe13bd083e264a50a136ad73058d6c543ea2652e8","logical_entry_identity":"e84c26fe73306baa70f5e2afb240c825a514ca3a1373b2c81315ed547ec121cf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You can't place a wormhole exit here.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你不能在这里安置一个虫洞出口。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"276ed0874fb908aff748ddf6a4d7b667c854f0909b8ce72b5171345c20986f0f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2d1394749149d5add46eaa52c941575367fbcde112c7d14bca3bbf8d4209dfe","logical_entry_identity":"723eb85593249345f7b08615c8b81d16d312a38d7dcdb2ed5a879335ddb51d28","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"These voratun gauntlets shine brightly beneath a thin layer of wear. Originally used in the spellhunt, they were often used to destroy arcane artifacts, ridding the world of their influence.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这件沃瑞钽臂铠虽然有一些使用痕迹，仍然闪耀着光芒。它最初在魔法狩猎中使用，常被用于摧毁奥术类装备，以消除它们对世界的影响。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1e89af97171235d886100f3ff64acbdc4ebd8b3d4c01bbb266218f7194938f71","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2d8e3b2be0ec87bb48ed2b5efe97a393bd458ae652c96aef57ecfdd74859c0a","logical_entry_identity":"abe697cf5251a627bdf71713d3d762a2ba35e2d1e182d877cb5110268b3869e4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rune: Acid Wave","source_tag":"talent name","target":"符文：酸浪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f0cb42ca1b57986e94ebb9814c7a39b9ebfae5552abeb66ab6e7685d564a3e95","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2d8f7c27649783679b6d0a7cc09408ad7ba226457f1f968db7c5cae6f2a4d16","logical_entry_identity":"bd2db024a79ab0fd3d55e34d828a0d9ed821d55abf87991df7c7d1a3b281c37e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"As you climb up the steps, you see Tannen standing with his drolem, reading a scrap of parchment.  As he reads, his eyes grow wider, and he starts sweating and pacing back and forth.  When he reaches to stuff it in his pocket, he sees you and jumps back like a startled cat.  \"No!  Not now!  You have no idea what's at stake!\"  He retrieves a fistful of brightly-colored flasks from his robes, and his drolem's eyes glow as it springs to life, metal screeching in an impressive imitation of a roar.","source_tag":"_t","target":"当你爬上楼梯，你看到泰恩正和他的龙傀儡站在一起，手中拿着一张羊皮纸。在他阅读的时候，他的眼睛越睁越大，汗如雨下，不断来回踱步。当他攥起纸条试图放进口袋里的时候，他突然望见了你，如同一只受惊吓的猫一样向后跳了几步。“不！不是现在！你根本不懂，现在是生死攸关的时刻！”他从长袍中拿出一把彩色的小瓶子，身旁龙傀儡站了起来，眼睛放射出光芒，金属的响声如同真龙的吼叫一般，让你印象深刻。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"efe0145e8b10e7b112bff824e7dfb99b9384013b2de33fd75b3914fc889b1f53","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2d985ff0894f4db3066ace8f6565c53068f398eedec5ea022e649848ddf3a31","logical_entry_identity":"70dbdbde423ccc604c1022949061019af4c5dc1cd283ac5df576b8714c9d027f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Earthen Barrier","source_tag":"_t","target":"大地屏障"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"881bf92b31b9ea9d99e0acbc7e428323381d6545bdcac551bacd63d775584d04","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2e31c79dc8ad6b834b0e4c3e9cf1f29d968e1b76b3097e70df29135e1170d2e","logical_entry_identity":"49d6d66dbb251d74c3e7f56140ec3961bb185f22109640cfab881f337693f8bc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"potent","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"强效"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7f111e07af070145dfab2b9595f444f5f897b6ad15e7c02ba1e1a936acf17037","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2e9dc6bb42744a64715a42f7e628b7a46b6084fb419700551ab091bda31fcfa","logical_entry_identity":"b06d8a9b60a9256aea19af4d232586118de92619d29c84b173911ffa49bfa0ae","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"autumn grass","source_tag":"entity name","target":"秋日的草地"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"60b558ecf8f9ab96a0a4f38c284f0e7c8e509f34dd677eb5be61251b161cd298","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2ec8c5dfca1ee10802900da4cab6a300b15c63ab10c4392b09f157d94d8527e","logical_entry_identity":"d4458afa52a4929eead1aee8d3a9b27a41307659cc7b44b17caf32ee9d193b82","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"In an extreme feat of agility, you move to a spot you can see within range, bounding around, over, or through any enemies in the way.\n\t\tThis talent cannot be used while wearing heavy armor, and leaves you exhausted.  The exhaustion increases the cost of your activated Mobility talents by %d%% (stacking), but fades over %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你迅速地移动至范围内可见的位置，跃过路径上所有敌人。\n\t\t该技能在身着重甲时不能使用，使用后你会进入疲劳状态，增加移动系技能消耗 %d%% （可以叠加），%d 回合后解除。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0b7384c2edfd5077f11856e8de2e75f0753e48abe8b383f4c41e70d10f8816e4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2eed34f586cc199b520871803c3969d0605be819fdcd611cff0055b47d7b88e","logical_entry_identity":"767d992d1895571655681d4f82f12abae6e8e9f6bbe92654d87c745fc078d6ba","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I don't have time for games, Cornac.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我没空陪你玩游戏，科纳克人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ab35c73804f195a1d151ff2d6bf0cd40536dfa27f5102d1c9ff26f1113194b52","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2f1710899e048f15797db9c5d3c38895a1190e6ddb41df2ff26323e0aa7c6bc","logical_entry_identity":"b83f8ec0c1ed297d8fc5044450f7567fab8901741a1e4778a176f4d3e75b4166","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#VIOLET#Following build order %s; increasing %s by 1.","source_tag":"log","target":"#VIOLET#遵循加点顺序%s;增加一点%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b7367deea5b5c6863097285617c3e389f2737e892a264e5f8480b71bb137f71f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2f7008db48fc5c803104c3a8a2a39f15aab80ea70d2526ddc2c40f97fd7e914","logical_entry_identity":"ad0be774d6d76b5238e739fe9549ff333ccc70294b92c35e9a5cea86f7355ac4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Oh Cecil, what must you think of me? But I remember your words to me, before the fever took you - you told me to live. And live I must... And yet that fever has now spread to me and I feel my days are numbered.\n\nI have a confession to make, my love. Those tinctures I brewed for you towards the end of your disease, those that helped you stay in my arms a few weeks longer, they were not my regular alchemy. In desperation I turned to darker arts in my obsession to save you. But though they kept your eyes open for a little longer, they could not keep you here with me.\n\nHow desperately I yearn for you... At nights the pain of my disease tears me apart, yet I could bear it all if only you were by my side. But alone I have not the strength, and the dark thoughts return. My obsession remains.\n\nYou would frown were you to see the things I have done. You would be sickened! I cringe each time I think of what your reaction would be to see me now. But please understand, my dear, please forgive me. For I must live! Though each morning I grow weaker, my determination to survive hardens. And it is not just for me...\n\nAmidst this darkness I have good news for you, my darling. I am with child. Though you have died your blood still lives in me, and even as my own flesh withers I can feel our baby blossoming within my womb. It is for this I carry on my experiments, gruesome as they be. It is for our child I struggle with hardened heart to extend my life ever further.\n\nI am cold and alone in this chilly crypt, thinking back on my times of warmth with you. Abominations lie beyond the walls, their haunting cries torturing my ears, reminding me of the black deeds I have performed. But every now and then I feel a gentle kick, and my resolve is stiffened, and to my experiments I return.\n\nI must live. For you, my love, I will live.","source_tag":"_t","target":"哦，塞西尔，你会怎么看我？可我还记得热病带走你之前，你对我说过的话——你要我活下去。我必须活下去……然而如今这热病也已传到我身上，我知道自己时日无多。\n\n我必须向你坦白一件事，亲爱的。你病入膏肓时，我为你炼制的那些药剂，让你能在我怀中多留几个星期的那些药剂，并非用我惯常的炼金术炼成。在拯救你的执念中，我绝望地转向了更黑暗的技艺。可它们虽让你多清醒了一阵，却无法让你继续留在我身边。\n\n我是多么渴望你……每到夜里，病痛几乎将我撕裂；只要你还在身边，我便能忍受这一切。可孤身一人的我没有那份力量，黑暗的念头又回来了。我的执念仍在。\n\n如果你看到我所做的事情，你肯定会不赞成。你会感到恶心！每当想到你若看见现在的我会有何反应，我便畏缩不已。但是请理解我，亲爱的，请原谅我。因为我必须活下去！虽然每个早晨我都更加虚弱，但是我的意志却更加坚定。并且这也不仅仅是为了我自己……\n\n在这片黑暗中，我有一个好消息要告诉你，亲爱的。我怀孕了。虽然你已经去世，你的血脉仍在我体内延续；即使我自己的肉体日渐枯萎，我仍能感觉到我们的孩子正在腹中成长。正因如此，我才继续进行这些实验，无论它们多么可怕。为了我们的孩子，我必须硬起心肠挣扎求生，不断延长自己的生命。\n\n在这寒冷的地宫中我又冷又孤单，我一直思念着和你一起度过的温暖时光。墙外潜伏着畸形怪物，它们疯狂的尖叫声折磨着我的耳朵，提醒我曾犯下的黑暗行径。但偶尔，我会感到腹中轻轻一踢，意志也随之更加坚定，随后便重新投入实验。\n\n我必须活下去。为了你，亲爱的。我将活下去。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"28c67ea3469ae67d94764ca99ec2189162e83c95d2eb524405e78b33e2916a54","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2f9f600c71270dd02170e541a10c5b75b9f526f033310ab9e9d65190a6bc234","logical_entry_identity":"2f9a3bcd6a5646f0b7293a0a2884796eb8f245dcd46a1fb8d7ddcc37a076f7fc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The flow of battle invigorates you, allowing you to press your advantage as the fight progresses.\n\t\tUp to once each per turn, while dual wielding, you may:\n\t\tRiposte -- If a melee or archery attack misses you or you parry it, you instantly restore %0.1f stamina and gain %d%% of a turn.\n\t\tRecover -- On performing a critical strike with your offhand weapon, you instantly restore %0.1f stamina.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"战斗鼓舞着你，让你在战斗中获得优势。\n\t\t双持武器时，每回合各至多一次，你可以：\n\t\t反击 -- 如果你闪避或抵挡了近战或弓箭攻击，你立刻回复 %0.1f 体力并获得 %d%% 额外回合。\n\t\t回复 -- 副手武器暴击时回复 %0.1f 体力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ddd7730ceaf8c4b0bfa480735bf1e421beb80a450619c0533cb31d7076a3e461","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2fec5a79446470f8238b32ce1fe778babd98c55a79cc634977a0444071989de","logical_entry_identity":"55befad5de19e89b0520e9f03e262fa31ef4324c147d67691bcf08eb0323ec35","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Focused on %s, +%d%% critical damage and +%d%% critical hit chance against this target.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"集中于 %s，对其增加 %d%% 暴击伤害与 %d%% 暴击率。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4095bd0edcd6e312f7c6149aa5e8e03b210ffadb17366e0fe12976d91abd9884","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c2ff2e4164cc2e140a5ae661f38d176b98a1571eb2294e5ec095be0685ddb3a0","logical_entry_identity":"00df388ad0c9c5c213f7858a3957b8fb99b143567035e4fe786d70f828a54124","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Zone-wide effect: +20 magic, +2 mana regen, -20 accuracy, -20 stealth power.","source_tag":"_t","target":"区域效果：+20 魔法，+2 法力回复，-20 命中，-20 潜行强度。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"48987a30f8d2941ea732a55ebc54b4b7fce0dbea22c208b358f67783e704a04c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c30571603764247102f4982d4e0a8e1e4663696dd3ece8af4a64b22efbdeb91a","logical_entry_identity":"c1c0fdd95f2aebb47499e74df463cee0b42866485b5501c5520c10fac588c934","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dirge of the Naloren\n\nThere once was a village\nthe Nalore held dear,\nbut when Ol' Walrog came t'pillage,\nthey cowered in fear.\n\nHe trampled their men\nand their babes newly born,\nand seeing it finished,\nhe summoned a storm.\n\nSo remember old Shellsea\nas she was in the past,\nfor Ol' Walrog sent the gale\nthat drowned her at last.","source_tag":"_t","target":"纳鲁精灵的挽歌\n\n从前有一个村庄\n纳鲁们快乐地生活\n当乌尔罗格来到村庄\n他们只能在恐惧中颤抖\n\n他践踏村庄的人民\n不放过初生的孩童\n他的力量毁灭一切\n唤起飓风席卷天地\n\n所以记住这个故事\n贝壳之海的湮灭\n是因为乌尔罗格的来临\n毁灭了贝壳之海。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81967a7a4aaffddc18ccf75d8f965dc571e43ec9fd0a2d3970eb59d23db84914","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c305b6f744461bfaea074de23b270ef24aa86e3a810679eb83d7c991d844d954","logical_entry_identity":"cde82dfd2a587accdda78742237901d6e244f09c69aeeb14fac3af066cae2500","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#VIOLET#As the bone horror is destroyed you see the remaining bones reassembling in the form of new foes!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#VIOLET#当骨灵恐魔被摧毁时，你发现它的剩余部分重组为新的敌人！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cf1ba3da29a1eae817635ec2a1e6b76506cb8bd25ce087d0c590fcf3103b0161","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c307cf2f9fe1bdce722080eb5acd44ed58c2b1aac8534d7b866a7a7e28525e65","logical_entry_identity":"d601c6e8e99e31bd8f3a97f0a9d5fb0f1ce0fd8d045db625f0854aab2219dfed","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The mental hold is gone!","source_tag":"_t","target":"精神枷锁终于解除了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5137faaa411f0a3f13f13080dbc2c2ae9bb09d01d57b7fae00d06736e223a512","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c30fe78fda33fae5450096e8890a3e8a5cfc3d0e1e96c02cbbfaddfec498f466","logical_entry_identity":"40758af0a927eff3d74bf365b9eb7ac528daeb568130a8c6a84325fd6d62079e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Power Overload","source_tag":"_t","target":"力量超载"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"31a91e1b4fd9dacde134644aca749f7ce24de26223c067d0e4e6801267794dac","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c312c5728c8cb3ceb5fa7a1c4bd59f21972e52fd6ece8219890bffccf8545528","logical_entry_identity":"048a189797690c18d4deb4745290eab011a2233a3512f60554d7ab6312a0e4dd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The rift leads to Maj'Eyal.","source_tag":"_t","target":"裂隙通往马基·埃亚尔。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ea37a6a22b1cdc93b95efa051e7187fd091e5aac2115e63904d36e1f4806ef29","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c31675562ea5dad8927c2bbf6e98ffb48c7ca73eca8ecdee7fd8e660cf5d1622","logical_entry_identity":"cf63aea18085f5858ecce6bb22af90070f6c724721afe01df58281e007741c40","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Won the game without ever taking off her bikini.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在没有脱下比基尼的情况下获得胜利。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"21a780ad81843dfa5cb7921416a761255e06c2215e176cc10e961a01d378e3c0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c31982f1367bf43894fd24b9389de1bce1a6f6062e38a3cac8e46088c608fe58","logical_entry_identity":"c56147eac300cc51e90f216a14e4913b407cc6395b1a2f9ae8cab2d3379a2292","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Each morning I wake, happy I'm alive;\nthe traps of this tomb won't claim me today.\nThough its curse of hunger eats at my insides,\nI curse it one better by having outstayed.\n\nSay a curse for the goblins' tortures that remained,\nand a curse for the gods who stole half the world.\nSay a curse for the chill that leaves magic drained,\nand a curse for the star that grew dark as it swirled\n\nBut most important of all is to note,\nin spite of fate's bias, only we survived.\nCurse the dead all you want, but we've stayed afloat;\nwe're the only ones blessed with the skillset to thrive.\n\nOur wit, strength, and teamwork outweigh cosmic powers;\nthey've done what they could but Spydrë is [b]ours.[/b] ","source_tag":"_t","target":"每个清晨醒来都很愉快\n坟墓里的陷阱今天仍能躲开\n尽管饥饿诅咒让我痛苦难耐\n我的诅咒更加强力，持久不改\n\n诅咒哥布林的厄运\n诅咒窃取世界的神祇\n诅咒吸取魔力的冰寒\n诅咒群星旋转变暗\n\n纵使命运不公\n如今仅我存活\n尽情诅咒亡者\n我等兴盛蓬勃\n\n智慧力量协作\n三者胜过万物\n他人尽其所能\n蜘蛛已然[b]归我。[/b] "},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6b24aa3ce9f440a825dd3e386ac81a458f74ab97b4a8bd6c4bdc9db6503b2187","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c31ac77284e55142dbaf6ff83c2ccd1af3f88ebf192406836263e4960fb25f10","logical_entry_identity":"2178a33d4be4827aaa3bd47262d0a7bfe99c426d7e549a8d5e7305c0c0717b95","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of madness","source_tag":"entity name","target":"疯狂之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b967646167913d12d85c2eef19a784c857676562ee84bde18243c9918ba23e9f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c31b775fdb1e14535695af0bdc283824605e10089da0da89a8b15fcaa0557931","logical_entry_identity":"e59bfa037864dbd54f51c14ee5be3335eb38d216847c997c32e05990273f2a60","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Pure Aether","source_tag":"talent name","target":"以太掌握"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f6f139ffe7855f04e1c06825fa72cad8ace2b51045d559032b27204a37902f6e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c31e1b38891fb58a416ff8f19d73ba73efaaa39c4c417fc30133e2c